# Technical Stack & Safety Rules

- Tech Stack: FastAPI + Pydantic v2, Flutter (GetX state management), Mistral/HF, PostgreSQL, FAISS, SSE.
- Tool Calling: LLM must use Pydantic tool functions (`search_flights`, `check_availability`, `calculate_fare`, `create_booking`).
- Guardrail: Never execute bookings without explicit human-in-the-loop confirmation (`POST /confirm`).
- Pre-booking: Re-check availability & fare before booking.
- RAG: Ground travel policy answers in FAISS retrieved markdown context.
